  unitName: Ukie
  unitId: 840827
  unitNumber: 8603
  description: "A competition! That was the most interesting piece of news Monkey
    had received in a long time. Emperor Yu seemed to be putting out a call for assistants,
    and they had to prove themselves worthy in the earthly realm below with one twist\u2014as
    humans.Already close in appearance to the soft-skinned two-legged creatures,
    Monkey was thrilled to be able to get up close and personal with her cousins.
    A known trickster among her fellow celestial creatures, Monkey was full of acrobatic
    stunts and ill-advised ideas; there was no telling what she would do while free
    of rules and regulations in the land of Man.Settling herself into the outskirts
    of a small suburban community near the mountains, Monkey chanced upon the sounds
    of crisp cymbals and plucked strings. There, atop a constructed platform, were
    a half-dozen extravagantly-dressed humans wielding gilded sticks, pointed spears,
    and colorful flags of all sorts engaging in some sort of ritual. With long, drawn
    out wails and shouts, they began circling each other, dishing out taunts and
    insults in flamboyant language. Immediately, Monkey was captivated: was this
    her chance to prove that legends do indeed exist?Despite having only just attuned
    to her new human form, Monkey grabbed the nearest weapon-like object and leapt
    into the fray.This was it. This was her chance to carve her divine deeds into
    the earthly realm\u2014for she was a celestial among the commoners! With a bright
    voice, she brandished the tonfas and declared, \"The Great Sage Ukie has arrived
    from on high!\""
  summonDesc: "Look upon me in awe!<br>I am here, the one known as the Great Sage!<br>I\u2014
    Huh? We're not starting yet?"
  fusionDesc: Ooh! Ooh! I want that one!<br>And that one!<br>Ohh, they all look so
    good...
  evoDesc: 
